 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566127444979-b3d2b654e3d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
 FALSE, TRUE),

(52, 'Fishing Harbour Visakhapatnam', 'fishing-harbour-vizag',
 'A vibrant sensory spectacle of hundreds of colorful trawlers, sea fishermen, and fresh catches.',
 'Established in 1978 adjacent to the outer harbor, the Visakhapatnam Fishing Harbour is one of the busiest maritime fishery terminals on India east coast. Hundreds of colorful mechanized trawlers set sail each dawn, returning with bountiful catches of tiger prawns, yellowfin tuna, pomfret, and crabs. It offers photographers an energetic spectacle of coastal commerce.',
 3, 'Port Area, Near Old Town, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530001',
 17.6975000, 83.3031000, 'Year-round (Best at sunrise 5:30 AM - 8:00 AM)', 'Open 24 hours (Busiest mornings)', 'Free entry',
 'Wear sturdy footwear and be prepared for authentic harbour smells and bustling fish auctions.',
 'Capture vibrant dawn documentary photographs of colorful trawlers, witness rapid fish auctions, buy fresh tiger prawns.',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507525428034-b723cf961d3e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
 FALSE, TRUE),

(53, 'Polamamba Temple (Pedda Waltair)', 'polamamba-temple',
 'A revered folk village goddess temple in Pedda Waltair celebrated during the vibrant annual Jathara.',
 'Sri Polamamba is an ancient grama devata (guardian folk deity) whose shrine in Pedda Waltair has been worshipped by fishing and farming communities for generations. The annual Polamamba Jathara festival draws hundreds of thousands of pilgrims, featuring colorful processions with illuminated Sirimanu poles, folk drumming, and traditional devotional offerings.',
 5, 'Pedda Waltair, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530017',
 17.7314000, 83.3347000, 'Year-round (Annual Jathara in January/February)', '6:00 AM - 12:00 PM & 4:30 PM - 8:30 PM', 'Free entry',
 'During the annual Jathara, the entire Beach Road and Waltair area becomes a festive carnival.',
 'Experience age-old Telugu folk devotional traditions, admire the decorated goddess idol, participate in community festivities.',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582510003544-4d00b7f74220?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
 FALSE, TRUE),

(54, 'Sampath Vinayagar Temple (Asilmetta)', 'sampath-vinayagar-temple',
 'The most visited and auspicious Lord Ganesha shrine in Visakhapatnam where travelers seek blessings.',
 'Established in 1962 in the busy commercial center of Asilmetta, the Sampath Vinayagar Temple holds a sacred place in the heart of every Vizag resident. By deep-rooted tradition, students, business owners, and commuters embarking on journeys or buying new vehicles first bring them here for Lord Ganesha’s blessings before traveling.',
 5, 'Asilmetta, Waltair Uplands, Visakhapatnam, Andhra Pradesh 530003',
 17.7236000, 83.3139000, 'Year-round', '6:00 AM - 11:30 AM & 5:00 PM - 9:00 PM', 'Free entry',
 'A quick and uplifting spiritual stop right in the center of the city. Breaking coconuts is a key ritual.',
 'Offer a coconut puja for good fortune before your journey, savor sweet laddu prasadam, observe lively urban devotion.',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582510003544-4d00b7f74220?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
 FALSE, TRUE),

(55, 'Thatipudi Dam Scenic View & Eco Park', 'thatipudi-dam-eco-park',
 'A serene forested lakeside park offering panoramic viewing towers, flower gardens, and calm boat rides.',
 'Set adjacent to the Thatipudi reservoir spillway, this tranquil eco park features manicured flowering terraces, children swings, and a raised observation tower overlooking the sweeping water mirror of the reservoir against the backdrop of emerald forested mountains. It is a favorite peaceful day picnic destination for travelers heading towards Araku.',
 2, 'Thatipudi Village, Near Gantyada, Andhra Pradesh 535215',
 18.1764000, 83.1931000, 'October to March', '9:00 AM - 5:30 PM', 'INR 20 adults, INR 10 children',
 'Combine with a drive to Borra Caves or Araku Valley for an early morning tea and garden stroll.',
 'Climb the viewing tower for panoramic lake vistas, picnic on green lawns under shade trees, take speed boat rides.',
 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80',
 FALSE, TRUE);

